{"seq":1,"slug":"life-and-times","title":"老子·life-and-times","stage":"DONE","category":"laozi","categoryLabel":"老子","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/laozi/life-and-times","rating":{"composite":3.78,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/15_laozi/1_life-and-times","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"生平与时代\">生平与时代</h1><p>老子（约公元前 571—前 471 年），姓李名耳，字聃，春秋晚期人，曾任周王室守藏室之史，是道家学派的开创者、《道德经》的作者。本卷讲述老子的<strong>生平与时代</strong>：他身处的春秋乱世、史官身份、史料中的真实与谜团，以及最负盛名的出关西行与著书。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本卷的定位-与兄弟卷的分工\">本卷的定位（与兄弟卷的分工）</h2><p>老子留下的史料极少，因此本卷的特色，是始终在<strong>史实与传说之间做分层辨析</strong>——区分哪些可多源印证、哪些是后世建构。本卷专注&quot;老子其人其事&quot;，不展开思想义理与文本细节，那些分属其他各卷：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>卷</th>\n<th>主题</th>\n<th>与本卷的关系</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>1 生平与时代</strong>（本卷）</td>\n<td>老子其人、时代、生平传奇</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../core-contributions/\">2 核心贡献</a></td>\n<td>&quot;道&quot;的开创、道家的奠立</td>\n<td>本卷讲&quot;谁&quot;，该卷讲&quot;贡献了什么&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">3 思想与方法</a></td>\n<td>无为、守柔、不争等方法</td>\n<td>本卷的时代背景是其问题来源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../major-works/\">4 代表成就</a></td>\n<td>《道德经》文本、版本、诠释</td>\n<td>本卷讲&quot;著书之事&quot;，该卷讲&quot;书本身&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">5 影响与遗产</a></td>\n<td>后世与世界影响</td>\n<td>本卷的神秘形象是其文化基础</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">6 争议与评价</a></td>\n<td>其人真伪、成书、诠释之争</td>\n<td>本卷给史料，该卷给完整论辩</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"三章脉络\">三章脉络</h2><p>本卷分三章，循&quot;时代 → 史料 → 传奇&quot;展开：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;第一章 春秋之圣&lt;br/&gt;时代+身份&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;第二章 传说与史实&lt;br/&gt;史料考辨&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;第三章 出关西行&lt;br/&gt;生平传奇&quot;]&#10;    A1[老子的时代] --&gt; A&#10;    A2[守藏室之史] --&gt; A&#10;    B1[历史上的老子] --&gt; B&#10;    B2[神秘的一生] --&gt; B&#10;    C1[出关西行] --&gt; C&#10;    C2[著就道德经] --&gt; C\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"第一章 春秋之圣&lt;br/&gt;时代+身份\"] --&gt; B[\"第二章 传说与史实&lt;br/&gt;史料考辨\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"第三章 出关西行&lt;br/&gt;生平传奇\"]\n    A1[老子的时代] --&gt; A\n    A2[守藏室之史] --&gt; A\n    B1[历史上的老子] --&gt; B\n    B2[神秘的一生] --&gt; B\n    C1[出关西行] --&gt; C\n    C2[著就道德经] --&gt; C</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>第一章 春秋之圣</strong>——<a href=\"spring-and-autumn-sage/the-times-of-laozi\">老子的时代</a>（礼崩乐坏的春秋背景）与 <a href=\"spring-and-autumn-sage/keeper-of-the-archives\">守藏室之史</a>（史官身份与学养）。</li>\n<li><strong>第二章 传说与史实</strong>——<a href=\"legend-and-history/the-historical-laozi\">历史上的老子</a>（《史记》三说并存的考辨）与 <a href=\"legend-and-history/life-in-mystery\">神秘的一生</a>（神秘色彩的文化建构）。</li>\n<li><strong>第三章 出关西行</strong>——<a href=\"the-westward-journey/leaving-through-the-pass\">出关西行</a>（事件与史料分层）与 <a href=\"the-westward-journey/writing-the-classic\">著就《道德经》</a>（成书情境与考据）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径与前置\">推荐学习路径与前置</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>前置</strong>：无须任何专业背景。若对春秋时代陌生，可先读 <a href=\"spring-and-autumn-sage/the-times-of-laozi\">老子的时代</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>初学者</strong>：按章序顺读即可——时代 → 身份 → 史料 → 传奇，是一条自然的叙事线。</li>\n<li><strong>想快速抓重点</strong>：直接读 <a href=\"legend-and-history/the-historical-laozi\">历史上的老子</a>（最硬的史料）与 <a href=\"the-westward-journey/leaving-through-the-pass\">出关西行</a>（最经典的事件）。</li>\n<li><strong>读完之后</strong>：转向 <a href=\"../core-contributions/\">核心贡献</a> 理解&quot;道&quot;的思想，或 <a href=\"../major-works/\">代表成就</a> 深入《道德经》文本。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>读完本卷，你应能分清老子生平中的&quot;史实内核&quot;与&quot;后世传说&quot;，理解一位春秋史官如何在乱世中写就五千言，也能说清为何老子的生平愈模糊、思想反愈纯粹。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"spring-and-autumn-sage","title":"春秋之圣","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/laozi/life-and-times/spring-and-autumn-sage","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-times-of-laozi","title":"老子的时代","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/laozi/life-and-times/spring-and-autumn-sage/the-times-of-laozi"},{"seq":2,"slug":"keeper-of-the-archives","title":"守藏室之史","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/laozi/life-and-times/spring-and-autumn-sage/keeper-of-the-archives"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"legend-and-history","title":"传说与史实","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/laozi/life-and-times/legend-and-history","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-historical-laozi","title":"历史上的老子","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/laozi/life-and-times/legend-and-history/the-historical-laozi"},{"seq":2,"slug":"life-in-mystery","title":"神秘的一生","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/laozi/life-and-times/legend-and-history/life-in-mystery"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"the-westward-journey","title":"出关西行","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/laozi/life-and-times/the-westward-journey","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"leaving-through-the-pass","title":"出关西行","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/laozi/life-and-times/the-westward-journey/leaving-through-the-pass"},{"seq":2,"slug":"writing-the-classic","title":"著就《道德经》","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/laozi/life-and-times/the-westward-journey/writing-the-classic"}]}]}